Package: usb-update
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, curl
Recommends: adstool
Maintainer: Beckhoff USA Community
Homepage: https://github.com/Beckhoff-USA-Community/USB-Boot-Folder-Update-for-Beckhoff-RT-Linux
Description: USB boot-folder update for Beckhoff RT Linux
 Updates the TwinCAT application boot folder and/or a published TwinCAT
 HMI (TF2000) project on a Beckhoff RT Linux device from a USB stick at
 boot, with operator confirmation on the HMI, automatic backup,
 post-boot validation and an on-screen revert on failure.
 .
 Intended for the Beckhoff RT Linux image (TwinCAT usermode runtime,
 sway/TF1200 UI Client, tcadstool from the Beckhoff apt repository).
 Not an official Beckhoff tool.
